From 683b7503edeb4b5101f36b7208ef099fde559a4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moritz Wegner <moritzwegner46@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:50:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: SharedDeck shared cockpit client mode

With L:SHAREDDECK_ROLE = 1 (client) every computing layer stops and the
state is mirrored from the host: Rust systems, cpp framework modules
(FADEC, extra backend), fly-by-wire gauge, systems-host, TCAS, FMS/MCDU.

- F/O sidestick inputs A32NX_SIDESTICK_FO_POSITION_X/Y into ELAC/SEC
- client FMS adopts the host's flight plans, RPC served by the host
- MCDU screen mirrored from the host, keyboard input forwarded
- failures from the client's flyPad forwarded to the host
- SharedDeck bridge (extras-host) between simulator and SharedDeck app

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
